headunit.crt and headunit.key are the public Android Auto reference head-unit identity
("Google-Android-Reference"), as shipped by open-source head units such as DiAuto
(https://github.com/shihabal3amri/DiAuto, AGPL-3.0), Open Headunit and
Michael Reid's headunit.

The head-unit protocol code here is an independent implementation. DiAuto's message
definitions were used as a reference for field numbers.
